flowchart LR
    EXT[Owner and AI coworkers]
    SRC[DotTalk++ source and usage contracts]
    HELP[(HELP DBFs)]
    META[(Metadata DBFs)]
    MAN[(Accepted manual manifest and artifact)]
    AIF[(AIF intake and atomic claims)]
    RR[(Global R register and ruling sheets)]
    RUN[(Run fragments and report envelopes)]
    TASK[(Task and project registries)]
    PROOF[(Proof registries and artifacts)]
    ID[(Identity and RBAC DBFs)]
    BBS[(BBS and Pseudo-Chat DBFs)]
    TRACK[(Portal DBFs: ruling lane run runlane proof task)]
    IDMODEL[(Identifier model and legacy crosswalk)]
    FEED[(Portal feed assertion and current-run registries)]
    STATUS[Generated Portal status and reports]
    LOCAL[Local AI Portal]
    SITE[Website JSON and MDX projection]
    PUBLIC[x64base.com reader]

    EXT -->|authorize and contribute| AIF
    EXT -->|attributed member| ID
    EXT -->|messages and returns| BBS

    SRC -->|harvest| HELP
    SRC -->|metacollect| META
    HELP -->|manualgen| MAN

    AIF -->|lane identity| TRACK
    RR -->|ruling identity and transitions| TRACK
    RUN -->|run and lane crosswalk| TRACK
    TASK -->|project and work-item state| TRACK
    PROOF -->|evidence state| TRACK
    ID -->|member permission grant| TRACK
    BBS -->|author run grant references| TRACK
    AIF -->|lane declarations and claims| IDMODEL
    RR -->|global ruling declarations| IDMODEL
    RUN -->|run and report identities| IDMODEL
    TASK -->|work item project and legacy ticket fields| IDMODEL
    PROOF -->|proof identities| IDMODEL
    IDMODEL -->|validated typed references| TRACK

    HELP -->|feed.dottalk.help_store| FEED
    META -->|feed.dottalk.metadata_metacollect| FEED
    MAN -->|feed.dottalk.manual_accepted| FEED
    AIF -->|current work authority| FEED
    RUN -->|current run pointer| FEED
    PROOF -->|evidence anchors| FEED
    TRACK -.->|future normalized read path| FEED

    FEED -->|validate and generate| STATUS
    STATUS -->|serve local views| LOCAL
    STATUS -->|reviewed projection only| SITE
    SITE -->|deployment and public verification| PUBLIC

    PUBLIC -.->|correction request, never reverse derivation| EXT

    classDef source fill:#e7f3ff,stroke:#1b5e9a,color:#222;
    classDef store fill:#f2e9ff,stroke:#6941a5,color:#222;
    classDef derived fill:#e9f7ef,stroke:#287a45,color:#222;
    class SRC,EXT source;
    class HELP,META,MAN,AIF,RR,RUN,TASK,PROOF,ID,BBS,TRACK,IDMODEL,FEED store;
    class STATUS,LOCAL,SITE,PUBLIC derived;
